### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 55/100.** Evidence TB2.1 49.4%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 55/100.** Evidence GPQA 63-81 variance ; HLE 5.5 ; LCR 28.3 ; Index 23.4; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 200K total (160K in / 32K out) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text in/out only; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 60/100.** Evidence SWE-Ver 0.68 ; LiveCode 81% ; SciCode 38.4 ; Vibe 3.1; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 100/100.** Free Zen tier $0/$0 stealth (GLM-4.6 proxy).
- **Overall Score: 51/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (55+55+70+15+60)/5=51.0 → 51; best-fit per scoring methodology.

